                        @* Section 3 — Account Types *@
                        <div class="br-section" id="s3">
                            <h2 class="br-h2">3. Position Sizing by Account Size</h2>
                            <p class="br-p">Your account size determines the range of lot sizes available to you. Smaller accounts must use micro lots to maintain a 1% risk rule without hitting the broker's minimum lot size. Here is a practical guide for each account tier.</p>

